Z||000014||Patrick||10-22-1999||12:31 AM||||<BR>batboy, it's kind of hard to describe, but on my '87 Coupe, both the front and the back bumpers have horizontal indentations (recesses) in them. On the front, these indentations are at the same level as the parking lights, and on the back the indentations are at the same level as the reflectors. In the picture above, you'll notice that the bumper is perfectly flat on each side of the reflectors. Is this what your '87 SE looks like? I'm pretty sure that the '88 Forumla has the same front and rear end as my '87 Coupe. Well, maybe I should just say that I think it's the same. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||5
