Z||000038||fiero56||10-27-1999||09:34 AM||||Looks like no-one heeded my advice on the spotters guide.  Well, I'm a nice guy so here are the numbers.  Fiero56 saves the day yet once more <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.  Transmision production numbers beginning with 1984 are:<BR>1984-<BR>Auto: 42.9% <BR>4-speed: 57.10%<BR>1985-<BR>auto: 47.0% <BR>5-speed: 31.20%<BR>4-speed: 21.80%<BR>1986-<BR>auto: 50.14%<BR>4-speed: 21.26%<BR>5-speed: 28.60%<BR>1987-<BR>auto: 54.63%<BR>5-speed: 45.37%<BR>1988-These numbers are broken down between coupe/formula and GT.  %'s aren't given as there was not enough room on a single page.  If anyone needs these numbers let me know and I'll type them up.||||reg||1
